=================================================

This code verifies the main theorems in the paper:
"The Infinitude of Twin Primes: A Proof via the Pair-Class Framework"

Author: Masayuki AOKI
Date: 2025-07-19
License: MIT

Requirements:
    pip install sympy matplotlib numpy

Usage:
    python twin_prime_verification.py
